<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/a-star-search> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Best-first shortest-path search that orders candidate states by path cost so far plus a heuristic estimate of remaining cost. The reviewed graph-search guarantee assumes nonnegative edge weights, a fixed admissible heuristic with zero at the target, and reopening on improved cost."@en .
