<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/binary-f1-evaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Given predictions and reference labels with a designated positive class, compute binary F1 from true positives, false positives and false negatives. The denominator is positive, or the procedure states a convention for a zero denominator."@en .
