<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/binary-f1-harmonic-mean> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "When precision and recall for the positive class are both defined and their sum is positive, binary F1 is twice their product divided by their sum."@en .
