<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/modal-necessity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/modal-logic> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/modal-necessity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "In Kripke semantics, necessity of a formula at a world means that the formula holds at every world accessible from it."@en .
