<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/submultiset-relation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A is a submultiset of B when every multiplicity in A is at most the corresponding multiplicity in B."@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/submultiset-relation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/scheme/mathematics> .
