<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/submultiset-transitivity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/submultiset-transitivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/discrete-mathematics> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/submultiset-transitivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "If A is a submultiset of B and B is a submultiset of C, A is a submultiset of C."@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/submultiset-transitivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/scheme/mathematics> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/submultiset-transitivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Transitivity of the submultiset relation"@en .
