<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/requiresPremise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "From a formal result to a hypothesis of the stated result or its claimed guarantee."@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/requiresPremise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
